ons</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.open.pilot.client.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Submits the current pending operation list to the server, fully replacing the existing records.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>Registration result callback (called back on the main thread).</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idisconnectactionmanager_clearpendingactions\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idisconnectactionmanager_clearpendingactions_inline\">clearPendingActions</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idisconnectactionmanager_clearpendingactions_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>clearPendingActions</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">clearPendingActions</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.open.pilot.client.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Clears the local pending operation list (does not affect records already registered on the server). If you need to clear the server-side records at the same time, please call this method and then perform the server-side clearing.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h5 id=\"Related\">Related:</h5>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idisconnectactionmanager_disconnectkeyactiontype\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">enum</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idisconnectactionmanager_disconnectkeyactiontype_inline\">DisconnectKeyActionType</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idisconnectactionmanager_disconnectkeyactiontype_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">enum</span><h3>DisconnectKeyActionType</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">enum</span> <span class=\"title class_\">DisconnectKeyActionType</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.open.pilot.base.disconnectaction</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">The execution type of the disconnect Key operation, which determines which method of IKeyManager is called when the server executes it.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Enum Members</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#idisconnectactionmanager_disconnectkeyactiontype_set_value_inline\"></a>SET_VALUE</font></code></td><td>Sets the value of the Key, corresponding to IKeyManager.setValue. Applicable to: restoring device parameters to default values on disconnect. Example: setting the return-to-home altitude back to 100m.</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#idisconnectactionmanager_disconnectkeyactiontype_perform_action_inline\"></a>PERFORM_ACTION</font></code></td><td>Triggers the Action of the Key, corresponding to IKeyManager.performAction. Applicable to: executing a certain operation command on disconnect. Example: canceling a waypoint mission that is being executed.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Class-Members\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">Member Index</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\">